      ],
      "source": "https://encyclopediaofalabama.org/article/grove-hill/",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Grove Hill became Clarke County's seat in 1832 because its location was most central to the county.",
